Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460,543)\fad(300,000)}Mei Ji\NThird Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan\N9-Leaf Shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you would have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,a strand of my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:11.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Domain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,That soul fragment I got from the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,was actually hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:36.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivators back then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,called me Mei Ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.29,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: "Mei Ji" means "Enchantress"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in the Forsaken Immortal Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am the Third Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you're the Third Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior trespassed here by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:52.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won’t hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, what do you mean by this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compared to "Third Ancestor"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’d much prefer you call me Mei Ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you’ve come here today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll let you leave
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third Ancestor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know what this is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Billion-Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're hiding here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it means you must be injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, don’t force my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will now take my leave
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Senior will continue to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:47.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a cautious little cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The more I look at you, the more I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one that I fancy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,can get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:03:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,capture him and bring him back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:03.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,456)\fad(300,300)}Tattoo Beast Atlas
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This scroll feels familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This scroll...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,why is it similar to our holy treasure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The holy treasure of the Forsaken Immortal Clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can he also have a Tattoo Beast Atlas !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:39.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is bad !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dragon, tiger, retreat !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which Ancestor is she ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,She willingly sealed herself inside the Tattoo Beast Atlas...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,this little cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,After tens of thousands of years...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man has finally returned !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:53.04,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318,478)\fad(300,300)}Situ Nan\NEarly stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Situ,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although I haven’t fully recovered my cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,it’s more than enough for this tiny planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:13.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, let’s extract your soul strand from the Cultivation Planet Crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:28.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1622,527)\fad(300,000)}Ancestral Spirit\NForsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Ancestral Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:34.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1610,540)\fad(300,300)}South of the\NSuzaku Continent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Ancestral Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Clan members, heed my order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Begin the chant !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Begin the chant !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Begin the chant !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The current forces of Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:36.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,are powerless against the Forsaken Immortal Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:40.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The two of you will face a life or death trial today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether you can survive it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,will depend on your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fifth Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Zhuque Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:13.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1572,523)\fad(300,300)}Sha Zi\NYoung Patriarch of the\NForsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Young Patriarch of the Forsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respect to Zhuque Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This humble woman
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,also pays respects to Zhuque Zi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:31.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,it has been 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you made your decision ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You also must have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,an 11-Leaf Shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:05.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You promised to split planet Suzaku in two
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,because you fear the Cultivation Planet Heart in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,If not for it, you would've attacked me long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do you bother with all this nonsense ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.72,0:09:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I give you the Cultivation Planet Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn’t that make me some meat on your cutting board !?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would be at your mercy !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I understand your concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Soul-Binding spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:38.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will bind your life to the Cultivation Planet Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If my clan betrays you and kills you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Cultivation Planet Heart will shatter as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,My clan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,would perish with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,With this spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can live out your natural lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,we don’t want to destroy planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just want a way to coexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now give me the Cultivation Planet Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this war can be avoided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Suzaku will be split in two
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and both sides won't interfere with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,As expected of my dear Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’ve calculated everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you know me so well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,what choice do you think I’ll make now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zhuque Zi,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re already at a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now accept your defeat !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.68,0:10:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Suzaku Seal...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,attack !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:45.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:46.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fifth Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,was killed in an instant ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We cannot do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:55.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,against Suzaku Seal attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,fueled by your lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:10:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,your lifespan will be exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you unleash one more strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,War or peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:11.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:20.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you remember our master,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,the previous Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Pinghai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You really betrayed him well !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Pinghai,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,you were wrong back then !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Terribly wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you still have a soul, take a good look
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:44.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the beloved disciple you appointed as the next Suzaku !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You chose
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,a descendant of the Forsaken Immortal Clan !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Pinghai,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yunque Zi and I joined the sect together
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and our talents were similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you always favored him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,while I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,was the odd one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as I lost all hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.80,0:12:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,you made me forget it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.68,0:12:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,by passing me the Suzaku Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the legacy of the Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I gave it my all to learn to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:23.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the Suzaku Formation is a double-edged sword !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:31.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each use damages the Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could you be so cruel !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You taught me how to be the Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:40.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,but never intended to pass the title to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You never imagined
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’d steal the Cultivation Planet Heart before your death
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and claim the title of Suzaku for myself
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if I wasn't the one you appointed !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior didn't even bury your corpse in the Suzaku Tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I sold it to the Corpse Sect !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This was the only way to alleviate my anger !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Pinghai,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,the truth is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:13.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I was the most suited to become the Suzaku !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I bear no hatred towards the Forsaken Immortal Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But my hatred towards you and him is limitless !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:22.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could I possibly share this planet with you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can’t be the first Suzaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will be the last !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I choose neither of your options.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:42.52,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268,441)\fad(300,300)}Cultivation Planet Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will play
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,a little game together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you win
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,then planet Suzaku is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,then everyone on planet Suzaku will die !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are you doing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:58.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cultivation Planet Crystal is in the Suzaku Tomb !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,All cultivators under Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,may enter the Suzaku Tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can try to retrieve your soul strands
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,or try to get the Cultivation Planet Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,But know that when I finally crush this thing to dust,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:23.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,all those who didn't retrieve their soul strand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:26.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,will die alongside the Cultivation Planet Crystal !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:26.88,Third,,0,0,0,,Be careful !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will give you 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're insane ! You're insane !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Suzaku Tomb is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,the game has begun !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This damn brat !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He dared to crush the Cultivation Planet Heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's courting death !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need your soul strand
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who can’t reach the Suzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,will all die !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:14:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're asking now !?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we had not started this war,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be in such a mess !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:16.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the lives of our clan are in his hands !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must play by his rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:25.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Send all members below 9-Leaf to the Suzaku Tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rest of us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,will look for a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old madman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't want to die alone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,so he's trying to drag us all down with him !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life and death are up to fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We must now go out separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Feng,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,remember to use the Suzaku Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This doll is made from celestial iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you're in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate its mechanism
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it will save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.56,0:16:36.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Pinghai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I found your descendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:53.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,he has the same Spirit Root you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I treat him just as you once treated me back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:05.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our plan is in shambles,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can no longer enter the Suzaku Tomb now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll have to rely on yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to retrieve your soul strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Suzaku Tomb isn’t large,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's divided into the inner and outer tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.44,0:17:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll first enter the outer tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single sweep of Divine Sense should help you find an altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pass through it to enter the inner tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is a mountain at the center,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,that is Ye Wuyou’s tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Find the crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and retrieve your soul strand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you encounter danger and need to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:37.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the method to break my restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:39.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It should get you out safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.60,0:17:47.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1413,590)}Entrance of the\NSuzaku Tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Suzaku Tomb is opening too slowly...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can it already be full ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since higher cultivation realms entered first
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,this delays everyone else for no reason !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this any different from waiting for death ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can’t see through him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person isn’t to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:08.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much longer must we wait ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Transformation seniors already entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since we arrived here first,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be our turn next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:20.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you were late,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to wait in the queue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't be rude !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Brutal Nan Ming,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:32.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,my disciple is ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.92,0:18:40.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:42.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,what's his cultivation level ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I sense
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,any spiritual energy from him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has shed his mortal roots and must be Late stage Soul Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only celestial spiritual energy flows through his meridians.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ordinary cultivators can't see through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s open !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s open,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,go !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry inside !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Move !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That gaze…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It feels familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don’t recognize me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I didn't forget about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,haven’t met each other in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.93,0:20:01.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.23,0:20:02.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:04.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:12.37,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:12.37,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:19.97,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:19.97,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:27.53,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:27.53,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:30.85,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:30.85,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:34.57,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:34.57,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:38.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.73,0:20:45.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:50.13,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:50.13,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:55.09,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:55.09,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.85,0:21:01.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:05.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:09.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:13.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.30,0:21:19.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:23.45,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:28.09,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:28.09,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.17,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:36.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:39.33,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:44.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:48.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.01,0:21:50.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:54.69,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:58.05,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:03.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
